booking and related requests through conversation and workflow integrations.</p><div class=\"tech-list\" aria-label=\"Technologies\"><span>Retell AI or Vapi</span><span>n8n</span><span>Webhooks</span><span>Database integrations</span></div></article><article class=\"project-card project-card-0\"><a class=\"project-visual-link\" aria-label=\"Read about Qalam CMS\" href=\"/projects/qalam-cms\"><div class=\"project-visual visual-qalam \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"qalam-screen\"><div class=\"qalam-rail\"><b>ق</b><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"qalam-content\"><small>STUDENT PORTAL / 01</small><strong>Good morning.</strong><span>Your academic space, at a glance.</span><div class=\"qalam-cards\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></div></div></a><div class=\"project-card-meta\"><span>Education · mobile</span><span>Concept</span></div><h3><a href=\"/projects/qalam-cms\">Qalam CMS<span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></h3><p>A university management application concept built with Flutter and a Node.js backend, focused on student-facing academic functionality.</p><div class=\"tech-list\" aria-label=\"Technologies\"><span>Flutter</span><span>Node.js</span><span>Express.js</span><span>MongoDB</span></div></article><article class=\"project-card project-card-1\"><a class=\"project-visual-link\" aria-label=\"Read about Mail Classification Automation\" href=\"/projects/mail-classification\"><div class=\"project-visual visual-mail \" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"mail-screen\"><div class=\"mail-header\"><span>INBOX / CLASSIFICATION</span><span>↗ n8n</span></div><div class=\"mail-row\"><i>↗</i><span><strong>Project update</strong><small>Priority</small></span><b>01</b></div><div class=\"mail-row\"><i>◷</i><span><strong>Schedule a meeting</strong><small>Calendar</small></span><b>02</b></div><div class=\"mail-row\"><i>≋</i><span><strong>Weekly digest</strong><small>Updates</small></span><b>03</b></div></div></div></a><div class=\"project-card-meta\"><span>Workflow de